<text x="15.24" y="50.8" size="1.524" layer="97" font="vector">5.10 V nominal = 0.6 x (1 + 75k / 10k). D4 blocks USB backfeed into BOOST5V.</text>
<text x="15.24" y="44.45" size="1.524" layer="97" font="vector">Place L1, U5, D3 and output ceramics as one tight loop. Keep FB away from SW and motor traces.</text>
<text x="15.24" y="38.1" size="1.524" layer="97" font="vector">Target 500 mA logic supply; verify startup and ripple with the actual SuperMini. RUN OFF for programming.</text>
</plain>
