<text x="15.24" y="50.8" size="1.524" layer="97" font="vector">GPIO0 / GPIO1 = left motor PWM. GPIO3 / GPIO10 = right motor PWM. GPIO6 = active-HIGH MOTOR_ENABLE.</text>
<text x="15.24" y="44.45" size="1.524" layer="97" font="vector">Initialize MOTOR_ENABLE LOW, configure PWM outputs LOW, then enable. GPIO4 measures VMOTOR through 330k / 100k.</text>
<text x="15.24" y="38.1" size="1.524" layer="97" font="vector">ADC scale: VMOTOR = ADC voltage x 4.30 (nominal). 4.2 V cell gives about 0.977 V at ADC.</text>
<text x="15.24" y="31.75" size="1.524" layer="97" font="vector">U1 footprint: 2 x 8 pins, 2.54 mm pitch, 15.24 mm row spacing. Verify the actual clone and keep its antenna area clear.</text>
</plain>
