<text x="15.24" y="50.8" size="1.524" layer="97" font="vector">TC1508A inputs must stay between GND and VMOTOR. TXU0104 isolates the unpowered motor domain.</text>
<text x="15.24" y="44.45" size="1.524" layer="97" font="vector">C2 belongs beside both VDD pins; C1 supplies local motor transients. C9/C10 bypass the two translator supplies.</text>
<text x="15.24" y="38.1" size="1.524" layer="97" font="vector">INA/INB or INC/IND: 00 = coast, 10/01 = opposite directions, 11 = brake. Motor stall current and heat need bench validation.</text>
</plain>
